    "facts": "The Constitution Bench considered lapse of acquisition proceedings and the interaction of possession and compensation.",
    "questionsBeforeCourt": [
      "How should the statutory lapse provision apply to pending acquisitions?"
    ],
    "ratioDecidendi": "Lapse depends on the statutory conditions and cannot be established by a unilateral refusal or incomplete tender analysis; the provision must be read as a whole.",
